        "message": "=<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#0b1020; margin:0; padding:24px 0;\">   <tr>     <td align=\"center\">       <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px; width:100%; background-color:#0f152b; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">          <tr>           <td style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#071a2f 0%,#0b3a5c 55%,#0e7490 100%); padding:40px 40px 36px 40px;\">             <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff;\">&#128737;&nbsp; Vigil<span style=\"color:#22d3ee;\">.AI</span></td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"height:20px; line-height:20px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:30px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; line-height:1.2;\">Vigil Summit</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#a5f3fc; padding-top:4px;\">Segurança para a Era da IA</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#ffffff; padding-top:14px; opacity:0.9;\">15 de outubro de 2026 &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; São Paulo</td></tr>             </table>           </td>         </tr>          <tr>           <td style=\"padding:32px 40px 0 40px;\">             <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#052e2b; border:1px solid #14b8a6; border-radius:10px;\">               <tr><td style=\"padding:14px 18px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#5eead4; font-weight:bold;\">&#10003; Inscrição confirmada</td></tr>             </table>           </td>         </tr>          <tr>           <td style=\"padding:24px 40px 8px 40px;\">             <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; color:#e5e7eb; margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Olá {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.nome }}, tudo bem?</p>              <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 24px 0;\">Recebemos a sua inscrição no <strong style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Vigil Summit &mdash; Segurança para a Era da IA</strong>. Sua vaga está garantida! Reunimos abaixo os detalhes do evento e o que preparamos para você.</p>              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#0b1327; border-radius:12px; margin:0 0 24px 0;\">               <tr>                 <td style=\"padding:22px 24px;\">                   <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12px; color:#22d3ee; letter-spacing:1px; margin:0 0 14px 0; font-weight:bold;\">DETALHES DO EVENTO</p>                   <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">                     <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#94a3b8; padding:4px 0; width:120px;\">Data</td><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#e2e8f0; padding:4px 0;\">15 de outubro de 2026 (quinta-feira)</td></tr>                     <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#94a3b8; padding:4px 0;\">Horário</td><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#e2e8f0; padding:4px 0;\">09h às 18h (credenciamento às 8h30)</td></tr>                     <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#94a3b8; padding:4px 0;\">Local</td><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#e2e8f0; padding:4px 0;\">São Paulo &mdash; endereço enviado próximo à data</td></tr>                     <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#94a3b8; padding:4px 0;\">Formato</td><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#e2e8f0; padding:4px 0;\">Presencial e exclusivo &mdash; 120 vagas</td></tr>                     <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#94a3b8; padding:4px 0;\">Investimento</td><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#e2e8f0; padding:4px 0;\">Cortesia para convidados</td></tr>                   </table>                 </td>               </tr>             </table>              <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 8px 0;\">Por que este evento é relevante para você:</p>             <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px 0;\">               <tr><td style=\"border-left:3px solid #22d3ee; padding:4px 0 4px 16px;\"><p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#f3f4f6; line-height:1.6; margin:0; font-style:italic;\">{{ $('Basic LLM Chain').item.json.output.angulo_personalizacao }}</p></td></tr>             </table>              <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 10px 0;\">O que você vai encontrar no Vigil Summit:</p>             <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 28px 0;\">               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.8; padding:2px 0;\">&#9656;&nbsp; Demonstrações ao vivo da plataforma de monitoramento contínuo</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.8; padding:2px 0;\">&#9656;&nbsp; Priorização de riscos por IA na prática</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.8; padding:2px 0;\">&#9656;&nbsp; Conformidade com ISO 27001, LGPD e SOC 2</td></tr>               <tr><td style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.8; padding:2px 0;\">&#9656;&nbsp; Networking com CISOs, CTOs e líderes de TI</td></tr>             </table>              <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; color:#cbd5e1; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 24px 0;\">Para garantirmos a organização e reservar o seu lugar, confirme sua presença no botão abaixo:</p>              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">               <tr><td style=\"border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0891b2 0%,#06b6d4 100%);\"><a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block; padding:14px 30px; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:10px;\">Confirmar minha presença &rarr;</a></td></tr>             </table>           </td>         </tr>          <tr><td style=\"height:28px; line-height:28px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>          <tr>           <td style=\"padding:24px 40px 32px 40px; border-top:1px solid #1e293b;\">             <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#94a3b8; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 6px 0;\">Nos vemos lá!<br><strong style=\"color:#e2e8f0;\">Equipe Vigil.AI</strong></p>             <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#64748b; line-height:1.6; margin:16px 0 0 0;\">Você recebeu este e-mail porque se inscreveu no Vigil Summit. Seus dados são tratados conforme a LGPD. Se não deseja mais receber estas mensagens, <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#22d3ee; text-decoration:underline;\">clique aqui para sair</a>.</p>           </td>         </tr>        </table>     </td>   </tr> </table>",
